<title>INDIA: Indian exports rose 2.38 pct in August.</title>
<headline>Indian exports rose 2.38 pct in August.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian merchandise exports increased to $2.60 billion in August, up 2.38 percent from $2.54 billion in the same month in 1995, the government said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
